d for cleaning home environment, b) use appropriate methods to clean home environment, c) appreciate a clean environment in promoting domestic hygiene. Learners are guided to: • discuss the methods of cleaning home environment such as mopping, dusting, sweeping and disposal of refuse, • apply the methods such as mopping, dusting, sweeping and disposal of refuse to maintain hygiene in the environment, • maintain clean living enviro','[]','[]','[]','[]','[]','[]','','kicd','active','https://kicd.ac.ke/','KICD Curriculum Designs','2024','2024','');
